 "blocks": [
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 3,
   "text": "Indicating that's all there is using 「だけ」"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 4,
   "text": "Vocabulary"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "1. りんご - apple"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "2. これ - this"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "3. それ - that"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "4. 食べる【たべ・る】(ru-verb) - to eat"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "5. この - this (abbr. of これの)"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "6. 歌【うた】- song"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "7. 歌う【うた・う】(u-verb) - to sing"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "8. その - that (abbr. of それの)"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "9. 人【ひと】- person"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "10. 好き【す・き】(na-adj) - likable; desirable"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "11. 販売機【はん・ばい・き】- vending machine"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "12. 五百円玉【ご・ひゃく・えん・だま】- 500 yen coin"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "13. 小林【こ・ばやし】- Kobayashi (last name)"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "14. 返事【へん・じ】- reply"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "15. 来る【く・る】(exception) - to come"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "16. 準備【じゅん・び】- preparations"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "17. 終わる【お・わる】(u-verb) - to end"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "18. ここ - here"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "19. 名前【な・まえ】- name"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "20. 書く【か・く】(u-verb) - to write"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "21. いい (i-adj) - good"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "The particle 「だけ」 is used to express that that's all there is. Just like the other particles we have already learned, it is directly attached to the end of whichever word that it applies to."
  }
 ]
}